# Yarn Only Package Management

Use `yarn` for all package manager operations in this project.

## Required

- Do not use `npm` commands.
- Do not suggest `npm install`, `npm run`, `npx`, or `package-lock.json`.
- Never run `yarn build` from the host terminal.
- Use Docker workflows instead of local build commands.
- Prefer Yarn command equivalents and `yarn.lock`.

## Command Mapping

```bash
# ❌ BAD
npm install
npm run dev
npx create-next-app frontend
yarn build

# ✅ GOOD
yarn
yarn dev
yarn create next-app frontend
docker compose up --build frontend
docker compose --profile production up --build frontend-prod
```

## Dependency Examples

```bash
# Add dependency
yarn add @mui/material @emotion/react @emotion/styled

# Add dev dependency
yarn add -D typescript eslint
```
